duction successful but transaction exceeded payment time limit',\r\n\t'2254': 'Business not allowed please contact overseas service hotline for help.',\r\n\t'2255': 'Wrong number entered or business not opened, please contact overseas service hotline for help.',\r\n\t'2256': 'Transaction failure for details, please inquire with your issuer',\r\n\t'2257': 'Card number entered is invalid please double check and enter',\r\n\t'2258': 'Transaction failed issuer does not support this merchant please change to another bank card',\r\n\t'2259': 'Card state is incorrect',\r\n\t'2260': 'Card balance is insufficient',\r\n\t'2261': 'Error with PIN expiration date, or CVN2 entered, transaction failure',\r\n\t'2262': 'Cardholder identity information or mobile number entered are incorrect',\r\n\t'2263': 'Limit on number of PIN entry attempts exceeded',\r\n\t'2264': 'Your bank card currently does not support this business',\r\n\t'2265': 'Time limit on entry exceeded transaction failure',\r\n\t'2266': 'Transaction has been redirected, waiting for cardholder input',\r\n\t'2267': 'Dynamic password or SMS verification code validation failure',\r\n\t'2268': 'You have not signed up for UnionPay card-not-present payment service',\r\n\t'2270': 'Requires encryption verification for activation',\r\n\t'2271': 'Bank card has not been activated for authenticated payment',\r\n\t'2272': 'Issuer transaction rights limited for details please contact your issuer',\r\n\t'2273': 'The bank card is valid but issuer does not support SMS verification',\r\n\t'2274': 'Monthly accumulated transaction counter exceeded',\r\n\t'2275': 'File does not exist',\r\n\t'2276': 'General error',\r\n\t'2277': 'partial success',\r\n\t'2279': 'Payment card has exceeded expiration date',\r\n\t'3000': 'SUCCESS',\r\n\t'3001': 'General error',\r\n\t'3378': 'Purchase is approved',\r\n\t'3379': 'Purchase is Successful',\r\n\t'3380': 'Purchase cancellation request successfully',\r\n\t'3381': 'Cancellation is approved',\r\n\t'3382'